# The M6 playthrough: a new party from New Phlan to Tyranthraxus (PlayBot, --play=).
# travel / explore use the lab's area graph (--exits=, from tools/sweep.gd's EXIT lines).
# Squares come from the area maps (tools/lab/plan.py, evmap.py) and the original's text.

log Party creation
char human fighter lg ARN
char dwarf fighter lg BRAM
char human cleric lg CEDRIC
char half-elf fighter/magic-user ng ELWEN
char human magic-user ng MARA
char halfling fighter/thief ng PIP
begin
expect 3:0
checkpoint start

log New Phlan: arms and armour (13,8), City Hall's commissions, the inn
shop 13,8 | 0 Long Sword | 0 Banded Mail | 0 Shield | 1 Long Sword | 1 Banded Mail | 1 Shield | 2 Mace | 2 Chain Mail | 2 Shield | 3 Long Sword | 3 Leather | 4 Quarter Staff | 4 4 Dart | 5 Short Sword | 5 Leather | 5 Short Bow | 5 10 Arrow
tour 4,4 4,5
face E
step
travel 3:0
inn 4,12
checkpoint shopped

log The Slums
travel 2:20
expect 2:20
# First pass: everything but the two big halls (9: the orcs' home behind the door at 2,3;
# 15: the hobgoblin training hall), which wipe a 1st-level party; they come after training.
explore 9 15
checkpoint slums

log Back to New Phlan: the clerk's reward, training, the inn
travel 3:0
tour 4,4 4,5
face E
step
travel 3:0
temple 2,12
trainat 8,0
trainat 6,0
trainat 5,0
trainat 9,0
inn 4,12
checkpoint trained1

log Kuto's Well
travel 8:29
explore
checkpoint kuto

log Podol Plaza and beyond (areas by the graph)
travel 1:18
explore
checkpoint podol
travel 3:0
tour 4,4 4,5
face E
step
travel 3:0
temple 2,12
trainat 8,0
trainat 6,0
trainat 5,0
trainat 9,0
inn 4,12
checkpoint trained2
stop
